Welcome to module 5, Procedural Testbench Writing. In this module you will master procedural testbench construction using verilog procedural blocks and c++ control flow.

2
00:00:12,326 --> 00:00:38,870
Here is what you will learn in this module. Procedural Constructs: Master initial and always blocks in Verilog, and control flow in C++ Timing Control: Understand delay control, event control, and wait statements Reusable Routines: Create tasks/functions in Verilog and functions/classes in C++ for code organization File I/O: Read test vectors from files and write results for automated testing...

